{"t":"SPCX","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"Space Exploration Technologies Corp.","ko":"스페이스X","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","employees":21000,"hq":"Starbase, TX, United States","website":"https://www.spacex.com","summary_en":"Space Exploration Technologies Corp. provides satellite-based broadband services in the United States, Ireland, Canada, and internationally. It operates through three operating segments: Space, Connectivity, and AI. The Space segment designs, manufactures, and launches reusable rockets to provide access to space. It also provides launch services for the deployment of payloads to intended orbits for commercial and government customers utilizing Falcon 9 and Falcon Heavy; and engages in the launch and development for the development of spacecraft and the provision of launch and mission services for government agency space programs utilizing Falcon 9, Falcon Heavy, Starship, and Dragon. Its company's Connectivity segment operates broadband data and communications network by various Starlink satellites in low-earth orbit, delivering connectivity to various consumers, enterprise, and government customers. The company's AI segment operates a vertically integrated AI platform spanning a frontier LLM Grok; AI solutions for consumer and enterprise customers; X, a real-time information, entertainment, and free speech platform; and AI computational infrastructure. Space Exploration Technologies Corp. was incorporated in 2002 and is based in Starbase, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Space Exploration Technologies Corp.는 미국, 아일랜드, 캐나다 및 국제적으로 위성 기반 광대역 서비스를 제공합니다. 우주, 연결성, AI라는 세 가지 운영 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 우주 부문은 우주에 대한 접근을 제공하기 위해 재사용 가능한 로켓을 설계, 제조 및 발사합니다. 또한 Falcon 9 및 Falcon Heavy를 활용하는 상업 및 정부 고객을 위해 의도된 궤도에 페이로드를 배치하기 위한 발사 서비스를 제공합니다. 우주선 개발을 위한 발사 및 개발과 Falcon 9, Falcon Heavy, Starship 및 Dragon을 활용한 정부 기관 우주 프로그램을 위한 발사 및 임무 서비스 제공에 참여합니다. 회사의 연결성 부문은 저궤도의 다양한 Starlink 위성을 통해 광대역 데이터 및 통신 네트워크를 운영하여 다양한 소비자, 기업 및 정부 고객에게 연결성을 제공합니다. 회사의 AI 부문은 프론티어 LLM Grok에 걸쳐 수직적으로 통합된 AI 플랫폼을 운영합니다. 소비자 및 기업 고객을 위한 AI 솔루션; X는 실시간 정보, 엔터테인먼트 및 언론의 자유 플랫폼입니다. AI 컴퓨팅 인프라. Space Exploration Technologies Corp.는 2002년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 스타베이스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":137.9323,"mcap":1873267392512.0,"pe":599.7056,"fpe":51.78591,"peg":null,"ps":58.46105,"pb":10.595507,"ev_ebitda":157.626,"div":0.0,"beta":null,"hi52":225.64,"lo52":104.83},"fin":{"rev":32042999808.0,"rev_g":1.614,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.56755,"op":0.01794,"net":-0.08613,"roe":null,"fcf":null,"cash":89855000576.0,"debt":39217999872.0,"de":22.186,"eps":0.23,"feps":2.66351},"own":{"short":0.020599999,"inst":0.49453998,"insider":0.12487},"analyst":{"n":37,"mean":256.41406,"median":245.0,"high":800.0,"low":70.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.7,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":8,"buy":24,"hold":6,"sell":2,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":8,"buy":23,"hold":6,"sell":2,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":7,"buy":23,"hold":5,"sell":3,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":6,"buy":22,"hold":5,"sell":2,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"China Renaissance","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":194.2,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"B of A Securities","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":275.0,"priorPriceTarget":235.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"Pivotal Research","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":260.0,"priorPriceTarget":230.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"Macquarie","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":250.0,"priorPriceTarget":250.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentP